{"data":{"body":"[P2] An interrupted close exits while continuation registrations remain and skips `validateRunningThreads()` and `checkpointManager.shutdown()`, allowing queued work and delayed backend requests to outlive invocation cleanup. Continue draining and shut down the checkpoint manager before restoring or propagating interruption, and add an interrupted-close regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-Dtd3","finding_digest":"47161be44c2843f16c2214eca9516c2b482387f83afaa42cd5541c8b65f52dae","finding_id":"arf_v1_i4lbxzcmfbb7c3bcctwksulmfn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","line":774,"observation_digest":"497e3fb6bf58819e5bada05dac4356291b3472ed9625b5cc20b654f69a72caba","observation_id":"aro_v1_jf7d7nv7lcaz4w5nubo2yq2wfe","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_i4lbxzcmfbb7c3bcctwksulmfn","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4kx76phfuc6jjlgxo4ldpuzjpc","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"05e32b6bcacefc9d71d0fb62fcfcd55e89119051","reviewer":"codex","start_line":771,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_o5b2key7fmetgya3a3nmwpbjg2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
